hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1337","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apni maut se saal bhar pehley Basra walon ki taraf likha: Majoosiyon mein har mehram rishtedaar key darmiyaan judai kar do. Aur Umar ne Majoosiyon se Jizya nahi liya tha yahan tak ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne gawahi di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajar key Majoosiyon se use liya tha. (Bukhari: 3156, 3157)"
"1338","[AI-translation] Amr bin Auf Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo Bani Aamir bin Luayy key halif they jabke wo Badr mein haazir huey they: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah ko Bahrein ki taraf bheja taake wo uska Jizya laaein. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bahrein walon se sulah ki thi aur un par Alaa bin Hazrami ko ameer banaaya tha. To Abu Ubaida Bahrein se maal ley kar aey. To Ansaar ne Abu Ubaida key aamad ki khabar suni. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Subah ki namaz mein haazir huey. Phir jab Aap ne unhey Fajr padhaai to Aap wapas aey aur wo Aap key saamney aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraye jab Aap ne unhey dekha aur farmaya: Mera khayaal hai ke tum ne suna hai ke Abu Ubaida kuchh ley kar aey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: To khushkhabri paao aur jo tumhey khush karey uski ummeed rakkho. To Allah ki qasam! Main tum par faqr se nahi darta. Lekin tum par darta hun ke tum par duniya kushaada kar di jaeygi jaisey tum se pehlon par kushaada ki gai thi. To tum us mein aik doosrey se aagey badhogey jaisey wo us mein aik doosrey se aagey badhey. Aur wo tumhey halaak karegi jaisey us ne unhey halaak kya tha. (Bukhari: 3158)"
"1339","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne logon ko shehron key itraaf mein bheja jo mushrikeen se ladtey they. To Hurmuzaan Musalman ho gaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak main tum se tumharey in ghazwaat mein mashwara karunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unki aur unkey Musalman dushmanon mein jo log hain unki misaal parindey jaisi hai jiska sar hai aur jiske do par hain aur jiskey do paon hain. Phir agar aik par toot jaey to do paon par aur sar key sath uthtey hain. Phir agar doosra par toot jaey to do paon aur sar key sath uthtey hain. Aur agar sar kuchal diya jaey to do paon aur do par aur sar chalay jaatey hain. To sar Kisra hai aur par Qaisar hai aur doosra par Faaris hai. To Musalmaanon ko hukm do ke wo Kisra ki taraf kooch karein. Aur Bakr aur Ziyaad donon ne Jubair bin Hayya se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha: To Umar ne hamein bheja aur ham par Noman bin Muqarrin ko muqarrar kya. Yahan tak ke jab ham dushman ki zameen mein they aur ham par Kisra ka kaarinda chaalees hazaar mein nikla. To tarjumaan khada hua aur us ne kaha: Mujh se tum mein se aadmi baat karey. To Mugheera ne kaha: Jo chaaaho poochho. Us ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Us ne kaha: Ham Arbon mein se log hain. Ham sakht tangdasti aur sakht aazmaish mein they. Ham bhook se chamda aur guthliyaan choostey they. Aur oon aur baal pehentey they. Aur darkht aur patthar ki ibaadat kartey they. Phir jabke ham aise they ke aasmaanon key Rab aur zameenon key Rab ne, uska zikr buland hai aur uski azmat badi hai, hamaari taraf hamaarey aap mein se Nabi bheja jinkey waalid aur waalida ko ham pehchaantey hain. To hamaarey Nabi, hamaarey Rab key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham tum se ladain yahan tak ke tum Allah Akela ki ibaadat karo ya Jizya do. Aur hamaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hamaarey Rab key paighaam se khabar di ke jo ham mein qatl kya gaya wo Jannat mein naimat mein gaya jo us jaisi kabhi nahi dekhi. Aur jo ham mein baaqi raha wo tumhaari gardanein maalik hoga. To Noman ne kaha: Shayed Allah tumhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath us jaisa dikhaa chuka ho. To us ne tumhey sharminda nahi kya aur na ruswa kya. Lekin main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ladai mein haazir tha. Aap jab din key awwal mein na ladtey to intezaar kartey yahan tak ke hawaaen chalten aur namazein haazir hoten. (Bukhari: 3160, 3159)"
"1340","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Tabook ka ghazwa kya. Aur Aila key baadshah ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko safed khachchar tohfey mein diya aur Aap ko chaadar pehnaai aur Aap ko unkey samandar (ilaqey) likh kar diya. (Bukhari: 3161)"
"1341","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo muahid ko qatl karey wo Jannat ki khushbu na paaeyga jabke uski khushbu chaalees saal ki raah se paai jaati hai. (Bukhari: 3166). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham masjid mein they to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur farmaya: Yahood ki taraf chalo. To ham nikley yahan tak ke ham Bait-ul-Midraas mein aey. To Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ho jao, salaamat rahogey. Aur jaan lo ke zameen Allah aur uskey Rasool ki hai. Aur beshak main tumhey is zameen se nikaalna chaahta hun. Phir jo tum mein apne maal mein kuchh paaey to bechey. Warna jaan lo ke zameen Allah aur uskey Rasool ki hai. (3167). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1342","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Khaibar fatah hui to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bakri tohfey mein di gai jis mein zeher tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey paas unhey jama karo jo Yahood mein se yahaan hain. To wo Aap key liye jama kiye gaey. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tum se cheez key baarey mein poochhne wala hun. To kya tum mujh se uskey baarey mein sach bologey? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tumhara baap kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Fulaan. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne jhoot kaha, balke tumhara baap fulaan hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha. Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum mujh se cheez key baarey mein sach bologey agar main uskey baarey mein poochhun? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan, Abu Qaasim! Aur agar ham jhoot bolein to hamara jhoot pehchaan logey jaisa tum ne hamaarey baap mein pehchaana. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Aag waley kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham us mein thodi honge, phir tum hamari jagah us mein aaogey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us mein door ho! Allah ki qasam ham tumhaari jagah us mein kabhi na aaeengey. Phir farmaya: Kya tum mujh se cheez key baarey mein sach bologey agar main tum se uskey baarey mein poochhun? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan, Abu Qaasim! Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne is bakri mein zeher rakkha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey us par kis ne ubhaara? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne chaaha ke agar tum jhoothey ho to ham aaraam paaein. Aur agar tum Nabi ho to tumhey nuqsaan na dega. (Bukhari: 3169)"
"1343","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisa bin Masood bin Zaid Khaibar ki taraf nikley jabke wo us din sulah mein thi. To wo juda ho gaey. To Muhayyisa Abdullah bin Sahl key paas aaya jabke wo apne khoon mein tadap raha tha, maqtool. To us ne use dafan kya. Phir Madina aaya. To Abdur Rahman bin Sahl aur Muhayyisa aur Huwayyisa jo Masood key betey hain Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf chaley. To Abdur Rahman baat karney laga. To Aap ne farmaya: Badey ko, badey ko! Jabke wo qaum mein sab se chhota tha. To wo khaamosh hua. To wo donon baat karney lagey. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum qasam khaao aur apne qaatil ya apne saathi key haqdaar ho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham kaisey qasam khaaen jabke ham ne dekha nahi aur ham haazir na they? Aap ne farmaya: To Yahood tumhey pachaas qasmon key sath bari karengey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham kaafir qaum ki qasmein kaisey lein? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use apne paas se diyat di. (Bukhari: 3173)"
"1344","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadu kya gaya yahan tak ke Aap ko khayaal hota tha ke Aap ne kuchh kya hai jabke Aap ne nahi kya tha. (Bukhari: 3175)"
"1345","[AI-translation] Auf bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Tabook key ghazwe mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap chamdey key khe mey mein they. To Aap ne farmaya: Qiyaamat se pehley chhe gino: Meri maut. Phir Bait-ul-Maqdis ki fatah. Phir wabaa jo tum mein bakriyon key marz jaisi phailaygi. Phir maal ka behna yahan tak ke aadmi ko sau deenaar diye jaaengey aur wo naaraaz rahega. Phir fitna jo Arbon key ghar mein se koi ghar na bachega magar us mein daakhil hoga. Phir sulah jo tumharey aur Bani Asfar key darmiyaan hogi. To wo dhoka dengey aur tumharey paas assi jhandon key neechey aaeengey, har jhanday key neechey baarah hazaar. (Bukhari: 3176)"
"1346","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Tumhara kya haal hoga jab tum deenaar aur dirham na logey? To un se kaha gaya: Tum use kaisey hota hua dekhtey ho ae Abu Hurairah? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Abu Hurairah ki jaan hai, Sacha Tasdeeq kiye gaey key qaul se! Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kis wajah se hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zimma toda jaaeyga. To Allah zimmi walon key dil mazboot karega aur wo jo unkey haathon mein hai rok lengey. (Bukhari: 3180)"
"1347","[AI-translation] Abdullah aur Saabit se Anas se (Raziallahu anhum) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har dhokebaaz key liye Qiyaamat key din jhanda hoga. Un mein se aik ne kaha: Nasb kya jaaeyga. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Qiyaamat key din dekha jaaeyga, us se pehchaana jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 3187). Makhlooq ki ibtida ki kitaab."
